WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.324 line:8%
Open Trash and select the correct record type.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:09.419 line:8%
Check the item and deletion date, then use Restore if it is still eligible.

00:00:10.441 --> 00:00:14.331 line:8%
Review the restored record in its original area.

00:00:14.331 --> 00:00:19.194 line:8%
Retention and dependency rules still apply; financial history is preserved.
